          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "adottare is a learned borrowing from Latin adoptāre \"to choose, to adopt\" (Lewis & Short), from ad- and optāre \"to choose\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
