            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ho un fratellastro più piccolo di dieci anni. I have a half-brother ten years younger."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La sorellastra — half-sister. In other words -astro can sound negative; here it is neutral."
            }
